  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Ocean Management in Caribbean Biological Corridor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to ensure that coastal and marine data will strengthen ocean management in the members countries of the CBC. This will in turn contribute to healthy and resilient marine and coastal ecosystems, species and the target communities in Cuba, the Dominican Republic, Haiti og Jamaica (Greater Anthilles). The project is conceived to strengthen the conditions and capacities of the CBC countries to improve knowledge on the status and vulnerabilities of marine realm.</narrative>
  </description>
